WEBVTT

00:06:29.446 --> 00:06:31.946
I wave no flags in my own life.

00:06:31.946 --> 00:06:34.085
But I was plagued by this question:

00:06:34.085 --> 00:06:37.031
How could anyone vote to strip the rights

00:06:37.031 --> 00:06:39.196
of the vast variety of people that I knew

00:06:39.196 --> 00:06:42.630
based on one element of their character?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.146
How could they say that we as a group

00:06:44.146 --> 00:06:47.079
were not deserving of equal rights as somebody else?

00:06:47.079 --> 00:06:49.446
Were we even a group? What group?

00:06:49.446 --> 00:06:53.313
And had these people ever even consciously met a victim of their discrimination?

00:06:53.313 --> 00:06:57.356
Did they know who they were voting against and what the impact was?

00:06:57.356 --> 00:06:59.247
And then it occurred to me,

00:06:59.247 --> 00:07:01.530
perhaps if they could look into the eyes